  "arabic": "غوط",
  "root_idea": {
    "summary": "The root centers on settling into a lower place, depth, and going into a hollow or depression.",
    "development": "From the notion of sinking or being low and deep, the lexical family extends to hollows, depressed tracts, deep wells, plunging, and related derived actions. The Quranic noun develops a euphemistic place term for relieving oneself.",
