      "meaning_id": "cm:gwT:ghait:land",
      "headword_arabic": "غَائِطٌ",
      "definition": "A wide depressed tract of ground or land; also a valley.",
      "usage_conditions": "It may be relatively shallow and may have bordering rises or meadows.",
